WEBVTT

00:11:59.938 --> 00:12:01.930
And I've been curious

00:12:01.954 --> 00:12:06.013
how you would talk about what you learned

00:12:06.037 --> 00:12:10.148
from your time with
Rosa Parks and Dr. King,

00:12:10.172 --> 00:12:12.428
what they taught you,
what they left you with

00:12:12.452 --> 00:12:15.448
that has allowed you
to do the work you've done.

00:12:15.472 --> 00:12:18.250
JL: There's something
about these individuals,

00:12:18.274 --> 00:12:20.767
they touch me, they reach me.

00:12:20.791 --> 00:12:24.005
If it hadn't been for E.D. Nixon

00:12:24.029 --> 00:12:25.404
or Rosa Parks,

00:12:26.582 --> 00:12:27.950
Martin Luther King, Jr,

00:12:27.974 --> 00:12:30.646
Reverend Ralph Abernathy